ation: accept the minimum valid volume layout, then independently alter the data start, data count and minimum volume size and require rejection. Evaluate all three malformed headers before asserting the result.\n\nValidation on aarch64 Linux with Rust 1.99.0: `make check` and `cargo clippy -p ginux-volume-format --tests -- -D warnings` pass. The standalone crate suite passes all five tests. Bypassing the final geometry reconstruction and validation makes the new test fail because all three malformed headers are accepted; the existing four tests still pass. Restoring validation returns five passes.\n\nThis PR contains only the new test and can be reviewed independently of the other storage tests. Production code, dependencies and licensing are unchanged; formatting passes.\n\nThe boundary-testing approach is adapted from [Aienux malformed-storage tests](https://github.com/aien-dev/aienux/blob/edac0f1b14dcc469fceb18783aa92ff6d92645b2/crates/aienos-kernel/tests/store_v1_negative.rs) (Apache-2.0).\n", "labels": [], "milestone": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2026-11-01T16:59:21Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-01T23:45:40Z", "closed_at": "2026-11-01T23:45:40Z", "merged_at": "2026-11-01T23:45:40Z", "merge_commit_sha": "c69d7ceff92512c39a59dfe83db28b76fd4d1254", "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "head": {"label": "aien-spark:test/host-geometry-independent", "ref": "test/host-geometry-independent", "repo": {"id": 1441894417, "node_id": "R_kgDOVfGQEQ", "name": "ginux", "full_name": "aien-spark/ginux", "owner": {"login": "aien-spark", "id": 330927100, "node_id": "U_kgDOE7mL_A", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/330927100?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/aien-spark", "html_url": "https://github.com/aien-spark", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aien-spark/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aien-spark/following{/other_user}", "gi